        "text": "The total value locked in DeFi, which measures the total funds deposited in DEFI protocols, grew from $250 million in the beginning of 2019 to a peak of $250 billion at the end of 2021. Some notable DeFi applications include stablecoins, decentralized exchanges, lending, and borrowing protocols. We will go into more detail in the next module when we discuss specific use cases of DeFi. First, from the user's perspective, the core benefit of DEFI is enabling easy access to a wide range of financial services, especially for those isolated from the traditional financial system. The most significant difference between DEFI and traditional finance or tradfi is, arguably, accessibility.",
